<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Kent Electronics.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Kent Electronics.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Robert W. Baird said it started coverage of Kent Electronics Corp with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 1-1/8 to 22-7/8.</p>
